"text": "vidra.configure(data_root=None, weights=None, env_file=None, hf_token=None) Call once, before anything runs. None changes nothing. Argument Meaning data_root Where output, custom questions ( prompts.json ) and custom aggregates ( aggregates.json ) live. Outranks VIDRA_DATA . weights Where checkpoints are cached. Outranks VIDRA_WEIGHTS . env_file A .env file to read now. Never overrides a variable already set; a missing file is refused. hf_token A Hugging Face token for gated downloads, for this process only. import vidra vidra.configure(env_file=\".env\", data_root=\"/srv/vidra\") print(vidra.__version__)"
